1
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,279
Boss, the car is ready.

2
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,039
Dieyi.

3
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,199
Why don't I come with you?

4
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:25,559
No need.

5
00:00:26,239 --> 00:00:27,519
It's been so long since then.

6
00:00:28,239 --> 00:00:28,960
Nothing's going to happen.

7
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,240
Where are we going?

8
00:00:34,439 --> 00:00:35,240
Minchun Pavilion.

9
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:41,159
Don't be afraid.

10
00:00:42,119 --> 00:00:44,520
You might have to suffer a bit,

11
00:00:45,399 --> 00:00:46,399
but you'll definitely get to

12
00:00:46,399 --> 00:00:48,399
the safest place in all of Rongcheng.

13
00:00:53,359 --> 00:00:53,920
Let's go.

14
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:36,640
Stay back!

15
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:42,560
Be good. Be good.

16
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:43,239
Come here.

17
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:44,719
Don't touch me!

18
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,359
Don't touch me!

19
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,960
I didn't think you'd actually come.

20
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:47,280
No one escapes Minchun Pavilion...

21
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,800
...unless Ji Chunyue allows it.

22
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:54,639
Minchun Pavilion is merely Sun Hanji's...

23
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:56,520
...playground to please the powerful.

24
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,039
And I...

25
00:02:58,719 --> 00:02:59,719
...am nothing but a puppet.

26
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:03,000
You know Sun Hanji's scheme.

27
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,080
Those women...

28
00:03:05,719 --> 00:03:07,360
...you let them out on purpose to find me.

29
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:11,439
Chen Dieyi,

30
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,800
I was right about you after all.

31
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,439
I agree to work with you.

32
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:21,599
Now state your terms.

33
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:27,039
You might have to suffer a bit,

34
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,039
but you will definitely end up...

35
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:31,319
...in the safest place in Rongcheng.

36
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,319
You bitch!

37
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,120
Where did you hide the coastal defense map?

38
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,000
I... I don't know!

39
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:46,240
You don't know?

40
00:03:48,759 --> 00:03:49,400
If you won't talk,

41
00:03:50,199 --> 00:03:52,360
you'll join Bai Yumei and Liu Furong...

42
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,120
...torn to pieces!

43
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:56,439
Torture her!

44
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:57,719
A VIP...

45
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:59,199
...has called for Jiang Liuli.

46
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:01,759
Who is it?

47
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:05,159
Deputy Chief Li Mingyuan of the Rongcheng Police Department.

48
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,240
Li Mingyuan?

49
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,480
Deputy Chief Li, what an honor to have you here.

50
00:04:25,519 --> 00:04:26,839
What business brings you here today?

51
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:34,879
Jiang Liuli is mine.

52
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,680
I'm taking her with me.

53
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:57,800
I'll owe you a favor, President Sun.

54
00:04:59,079 --> 00:04:59,639
Please.

55
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,079
When did she

56
00:05:10,079 --> 00:05:11,480
land such a powerful patron?

57
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,720
He came a few times,

58
00:05:14,279 --> 00:05:15,240
only ever asking for Jiang Liuli.

59
00:05:15,759 --> 00:05:17,639
I thought he was just an ordinary VIP.

60
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:20,360
Who knew he was such a big shot?

61
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,199
This Li Mingyuan

62
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,079
is upright and incorruptible,

63
00:05:25,079 --> 00:05:25,920
completely impervious.

64
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:29,600
Turns out even heroes fall for beauties.

65
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:32,199
Indeed.

66
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,319
Come on in.

67
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,480
From now on, you'll stay in my room.

68
00:05:46,319 --> 00:05:47,279
I need your cooperation

69
00:05:48,439 --> 00:05:49,360
to win Sun Hanji's trust.

70
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,759
Until we get the complete coastal defense map,

71
00:05:52,079 --> 00:05:54,399
I'll ensure your safety during this time.

72
00:05:56,079 --> 00:05:57,120
Sister Dieyi was right.

73
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:58,959
Nowhere in Rongcheng

74
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,519
is safer than the Deputy Chief's home.

75
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,319
Young Master.

76
00:06:06,279 --> 00:06:07,959
This ointment reduces swelling and inflammation.

77
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:09,680
Thank you.

78
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:12,360
If you need anything, just ask the servants.

79
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:13,680
I'm heading back to the police station.

80
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:14,879
All right.

81
00:06:31,279 --> 00:06:31,879
Mingyuan.

82
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,199
Mingyuan!

83
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,480
I heard a joke outside today.

84
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,720
They say you've fallen for...

85
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:41,199
a woman from Minchun Pavilion.

86
00:06:42,439 --> 00:06:43,319
A prostitute!

87
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,959
And even brought her home.

88
00:06:45,879 --> 00:06:47,839
Isn't... isn't that ridiculous?

89
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,680
It's true.

90
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:53,519
Mingyuan, you just became Deputy Chief.

91
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,199
So many eyes are on you right now.

92
00:06:55,839 --> 00:06:56,839
If you want to get married,

93
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:58,560
you have your pick of ladies from good families!

94
00:06:59,519 --> 00:07:00,240
As for that...

95
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:01,279
that woman...

96
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:03,399
Just let her go, will you?

97
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:04,319
Father.

98
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:06,040
You don't need to meddle in my affairs.

99
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,560
Mingyuan...

100
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,079
Your mother died young.

101
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,879
I raised you all on my own,

102
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:17,720
and you never gave me cause to worry.

103
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,879
You always observed decorum,

104
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,240
strove for the top,

105
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:22,240
and never took a wrong step.

106
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:23,680
But this time,

107
00:07:24,439 --> 00:07:26,160
don't go doing something foolish!

108
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,759
I'm a grown man now.

109
00:07:29,399 --> 00:07:31,000
I have the right to choose my own path.

110
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,040
I know what I'm doing.

111
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:35,399
You don't need to worry.

112
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,120
Jin Xiaohua.

113
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:47,720
Jin Xiaohua, are you there?

114
00:07:48,639 --> 00:07:49,439
I need to talk to you.

115
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,720
What happened?

116
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:03,360
She...

117
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,319
She left on her own.

118
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,240
The room is in such a mess!

119
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,759
How could she have left on her own?

120
00:08:08,639 --> 00:08:09,319
Tell the truth!

121
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,240
Deputy Boss Yan...

122
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,000
heard she's a Minchun Pavilion prostitute,

123
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,319
felt it was disgraceful,

124
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,800
so he had us kick her out.

125
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,000
Ticket.

126
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,600
I'll buy one on board!

127
00:08:25,199 --> 00:08:26,959
Keep running, you bitch!

128
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:27,800
Hand it over!

129
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:32,919
Where's the map?

130
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:33,799
Where did you hide it?

131
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:34,639
I don't have it!

132
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:35,879
I don't!

133
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,360
Are you hiding it on you?

134
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,159
No!

135
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,399
Let me search you myself!

136
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,159
B-Brother...

137
00:08:45,399 --> 00:08:46,759
Calm down! Don't do anything rash!

138
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:49,919
Brother Lian...

139
00:08:50,559 --> 00:08:51,679
Brother Lian, don't be rash! Brother Lian!

140
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:52,720
Don't do it!

141
00:08:53,799 --> 00:08:54,600
All right, all right, all right!

142
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:55,720
W-We're leaving right now!

143
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:56,759
Let's go, let's go!

144
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:02,279
Stay back!

145
00:09:02,759 --> 00:09:03,399
Stay back!

146
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,000
Don't come any closer!

147
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:08,639
I won't give you the map!

148
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:10,000
Never!

149
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:14,960
I work for Chen Dieyi.

150
00:09:16,519 --> 00:09:17,600
Dieyi sent me to rescue you!

151
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,600
Chen Dieyi?

152
00:09:44,399 --> 00:09:45,000
Leave us.

153
00:09:46,679 --> 00:09:47,399
Chief Li,

154
00:09:48,279 --> 00:09:48,960
this here

155
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,799
is fresh green tea from Yongtai.

156
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,200
Have a taste.

157
00:09:53,519 --> 00:09:54,519
In the past,

158
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,840
no invitation could ever bring you here.

159
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:00,639
Why the sudden visit today?

160
00:10:05,799 --> 00:10:06,440
Have some tea first.

161
00:10:08,039 --> 00:10:08,879
Thank you, President Sun.

162
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:14,759
Fine tea.

163
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,879
Chief Li, paying a personal visit...

164
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:21,919
What business brings you here?

165
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,759
Liuli misses her two sisters.

166
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:27,480
I heard they're both here with you.

167
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:30,919
Would you mind letting them catch up?

168
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:32,879
Of course.

169
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:34,639
Go on.

170
00:10:36,039 --> 00:10:36,559
Go ahead.

171
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:47,840
Liuli told me.

172
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:52,120
The deaths of Bai Yumei and Liu Furong

173
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,720
are tied to the coastal defense map.

174
00:11:06,399 --> 00:11:07,519
No need to be nervous, President Sun.

175
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,600
I can sweep this case

176
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:14,919
under the rug.

177
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:19,840
Chief Li,

178
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:23,240
what do you want from me?

179
00:11:25,639 --> 00:11:26,879
In these turbulent times,

180
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,559
our country's cause is already lost.

181
00:11:29,279 --> 00:11:31,480
I want to choose the winning side,

182
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,360
just like you, President Sun.

183
00:11:34,039 --> 00:11:36,519
Giving our patron the coastal defense map

184
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:39,279
will be proof of my sincerity.

185
00:11:43,639 --> 00:11:44,720
Chief Li...

186
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:48,240
Just burying these two cases isn't enough.

187
00:11:51,559 --> 00:11:52,039
Tell you what.

188
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,440
Tomorrow,

189
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:59,360
how about joining me for a hunt?

190
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,039
I'd be honored.

191
00:12:01,559 --> 00:12:02,279
It's a deal.

192
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,159
It's a deal.

193
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:14,639
Hurry!

194
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,159
What are you doing here?

195
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,600
Didn't I tell you to run?

196
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,320
Chen Dieyi made her move.

197
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,240
Hang in there a little longer.

198
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:33,879
We'll come rescue you soon.
